  m_Name: Level 1 Questions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HokkienQuizQuestionBank
  questions:
  - question: 'Which of the following means "How do you sell this?"

'
    choices:
    - "L\u0101u-p\u00E1n h\u00F3"
    - "Ch\u00F3a\u207F b\u014De?"
    - "L\u00ED beh g\u014Da-ch\u014De?"
    - "Chhi\u00E1\u207F-mn\u0304g, che s\u012B si\u00E1nn-mih?"
    choiceHokkienRomanizedTexts:
    - ""
    - ""
    - ""
    - ""
    choiceAudioResourcePaths:
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_boss_hello
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_how_sell
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_how_many
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_what_is_this
    choiceExplanations:
    - "This means \u201CHello Boss\u201D, which is a greeting to the stall owner."
    - "This means \u201Chow do you sell this\u201D, used to ask about the price of
      the dish"
    - "This means \u201Chow much do you want?\u201D, used by the vendor to ask how
      much of something the buyer wants."
    - "This means \u201CWhat is this?\u201D, you can use this to ask what others
      are eating or selling."
    correctAnswerIndex: 1
  - question: If you want to ask about what a food is, what do you say?
    choices:
    - "L\u0101u-p\u00E1n h\u00F3"
    - "Ch\u00F3a\u207F b\u014De?"
    - "L\u00ED beh g\u014Da-ch\u014De?"
    - "Chhi\u00E1\u207F-mn\u0304g, che s\u012B si\u00E1nn-mih?"
    choiceHokkienRomanizedTexts:
    - ""
    - ""
    - ""
    - ""
    choiceAudioResourcePaths:
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_boss_hello
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_how_sell
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_how_many
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_what_is_this
    choiceExplanations:
    - "This means \u201CHello Boss\u201D, which is a greeting to the stall owner."
    - "This means \u201Chow do you sell this\u201D, used to ask about the price of
      the dish"
    - "This means \u201Chow much do you want?\u201D, used by the vendor to ask how
      much of something the buyer wants."
    - "This means \u201CWhat is this?\u201D, you can use this to ask what others
      are eating or selling."
    correctAnswerIndex: 3
  - question: "Which of the following is traditionally used as a worship food for the Seven Sisters festival?"
    choices:
    - "\u00D4ng-l\u00E2i-so\u0358"
    - "T\u00E2ng-\u00E1-b\u00ED-ko"
    - "\u014C\u0358-ku\u00E9-khiau"
    - "Pe\u030Dh-thn\u0302g-ku\u00E9"
    choiceHokkienRomanizedTexts:
    - ""
    - ""
    - ""
    - ""
    choiceAudioResourcePaths:
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_pineapple_cake
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_tube_rice
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_taro_cake
    - HokkienQuizAudio/level1_sweet_rice_cake
    choiceExplanations:
    - Pineapple cake is a popular Taiwanese snack, but not the expected worship food here.
    - Tube rice pudding is not the expected worship food here.
    - Steamed taro cake is associated with other worship traditions.
    - Fried sweet rice cake is the expected answer for this lesson.
    correctAnswerIndex: 3
